<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Dataset Construction Details ‣ RewardMap: Tackling Sparse Rewards in Fine-grained Visual Reasoning via Multi-Stage Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>, we provide a statistical overview of <span id="Ax1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ReasonMap-Plus</span> and its question templates. Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B RewardMap Details ‣ RewardMap: Tackling Sparse Rewards in Fine-grained Visual Reasoning via Multi-Stage Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a> outlines the computation pipeline of the detail reward. Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Evaluation Details ‣ RewardMap: Tackling Sparse Rewards in Fine-grained Visual Reasoning via Multi-Stage Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> describes evaluation settings, including difficulty-aware weighting, benchmark datasets, and result sources in Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5.2 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ RewardMap: Tackling Sparse Rewards in Fine-grained Visual Reasoning via Multi-Stage Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. Finally, Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Large Language Model Usage Statement ‣ RewardMap: Tackling Sparse Rewards in Fine-grained Visual Reasoning via Multi-Stage Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a> presents the statement on LLM usage.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Dataset Construction Details</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Statistical Overview</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ReasonMap-Plus</span> mirrors <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ReasonMap</span> in image composition, comprising high-resolution transit maps from <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>30</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">30</annotation></semantics></math> cities. It contains <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4,018" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>4,018</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4,018</annotation></semantics></math> questions across five categories (<span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">e.g.</span>, Local Counting 1 - <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,050" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,050</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,050</annotation></semantics></math>; Local Counting 2 - <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="970" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>970</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">970</annotation></semantics></math>; Global Counting - <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>30</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">30</annotation></semantics></math>; True or False 1 - <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,039" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,039</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,039</annotation></semantics></math>; True or False 2 - 929), with a difficulty distribution of <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,259" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,259</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,259</annotation></semantics></math> easy, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,342" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,342</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,342</annotation></semantics></math> middle, and <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,417" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,417</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,417</annotation></semantics></math> hard. To preserve difficulty balance and diversity, we adopt the same split as <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ReasonMap</span>, using questions from <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="11" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>11</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">11</annotation></semantics></math> cities for the test set (<math id="A1.SS1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,448" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1,448</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,448</annotation></semantics></math>) and the remainder for the training set (<math id="A1.SS1.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2,570" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2,570</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2,570</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Question Template</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the question templates of <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ReasonMap-Plus</span> as follows.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="292.54" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 292.54" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,292.54) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 286.63 C 0 289.9 2.64 292.54 5.91 292.54 L 544.09 292.54 C 547.36 292.54 550 289.9 550 286.63 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 268.43 L 548.03 268.43 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 277.03)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.84em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="440.58"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.84em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Local Counting 1</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:17.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="242.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 242.84)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please solve the multiple choice problem and put your answer (one of ABCD) in one ”
<br class="ltx_break">boxed”. According to the subway map, how many intermediate stops are there between stop 1 and stop 2 (except for this two stops)?
A) x
B) x
C) x
D) x</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="111.81" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 111.81" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,111.81) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 105.91 C 0 109.17 2.64 111.81 5.91 111.81 L 544.09 111.81 C 547.36 111.81 550 109.17 550 105.91 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 87.7 L 548.03 87.7 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 96.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.84em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="440.58"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.84em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Local Counting 2</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="62.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
